  "news.info.1": "This game uses printed zines for technical reference, storytelling, and general attitude. There are two issues, unlocked at different points in the game.",
  "news.info.2": "We recommend you print and assemble the zines for the most authentic and enjoyable EXAPUNKS experience. However, we have also included a digital version with a screen-friendly layout.",
